WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.440
- Now, anything surprise you
about working with Johnny?

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.150
Was this, do you realize, oh,
this is exactly where I am,

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.370
we're on the same head space

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.364
or this guy is so much
further gone than I am?

00:00:10.364 --> 00:00:11.630
What was the feeling?

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.390
- Well, it was funny because
the first day we get to set,

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:16.530
you know, Knoxville looks like

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.810
the Knoxville I grew up
watching on television.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.251
He had dark hair.

00:00:20.251 --> 00:00:23.210
He looked pretty much the same to me .

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:26.870
And then, you know, as
we started filming more,

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:28.430
one day, he shows up to set

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.023
looking like Silver Foxville here.

00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:33.470
- Oh, Rachel.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.380
- [Rachel] And I was like, what is,

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.420
I don't recognize this person.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:41.100
And I think me and the internet both agree

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.180
that he has a strong
resemblance to Jamie Lee Curtis.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:46.810
- [Jay] Jamie Lee Curtis?

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.650
Do we have a, is that, do we have a photo?

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:49.483
Let's take a look.

00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:50.316
- [Johnny] Let's see.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:52.900
Okay.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.850
- [Rachel] I thought I was
on the set of Halloween.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:55.950
- [Jay] Yeah, not bad.

00:00:56.795 --> 00:00:57.800
Not bad.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.800
Well, here's what I don't understand.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.020
In the first half of the
movie, he had black hair?

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:02.853
- [Rachel] Mm-hmm.

00:01:02.853 --> 00:01:04.200
- And then one day he showed up with gray?

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.500
- [Johnny] After COVID,
during the COVID break.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.150
We started filming in March,

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:11.000
we started filming in 2020 in February

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.630
then we got shut down in March

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.320
and we resumed again in September.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.040
So between that time, I became.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:17.910
- [Jay] Yeah but most
films have what they call

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.590
a continuity person and they will say,

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:22.530
oh, you have the ring on the wrong finger.

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:24.320
They'll notice the smallest thing.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.690
I mean, when you came in,

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.440
when you come in with black
hair and then the silver,

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.060
sends some guy, hey, wait a minute

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.290
it doesn't quite match.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.680
- You know, we don't have
a continuity person, Jay.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:34.513
- [Jay] Really?

00:01:34.513 --> 00:01:35.346
- Yeah.

00:01:35.346 --> 00:01:36.292
- [Jay] I'm stunned.

00:01:36.292 --> 00:01:37.125
- Unbelievably.

00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:37.958
- Oh, all right. Okay.

